[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 182.75, "timestamp": "00:03:02", "text": "大概联系了其中的74个人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 187.11, "timestamp": "00:03:07", "text": "呃，大概有30个人准备好了，就像谁一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 189.03, "timestamp": "00:03:09", "text": "可以免费参加"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 190.869, "timestamp": "00:03:10", "text": "进来放东西。所以，我必须找到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 193.75, "timestamp": "00:03:13", "text": "是时候把它们全都弄上去了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 197.19, "timestamp": "00:03:17", "text": "一切都开始了。如果我不能"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 199.50900000000001, "timestamp": "00:03:19", "text": "与他们进行一对一的合作，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 201.91, "timestamp": "00:03:21", "text": "我会把它们添加到一组中，也就是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 204.03, "timestamp": "00:03:24", "text": "第一组正在进行中，接下来会发生什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 208.63, "timestamp": "00:03:28", "text": "星期。是的，就是这样。但我感觉"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 210.869, "timestamp": "00:03:30", "text": "就像这一切结束后，等我安顿下来之后……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 214.47, "timestamp": "00:03:34", "text": "到八月份左右，一切都会恢复原状。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 216.67000000000002, "timestamp": "00:03:36", "text": "我即将开始直播"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 220.55, "timestamp": "00:03:40", "text": "再次。到那时我就可以玩暴力游戏了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 222.71, "timestamp": "00:03:42", "text": "还有一些诸如速度慢之类的事情，你知道，一个小时就结束了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 227.27, "timestamp": "00:03:47", "text": "或每天直播 2 小时，最长 1 小时。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 228.82999999999998, "timestamp": "00:03:48", "text": "最低 I"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 231.11, "timestamp": "00:03:51", "text": "看来我没办法了，我没法直播。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 234.11, "timestamp": "00:03:54", "text": "就像我现在这样，得去工作了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 236.869, "timestamp": "00:03:56", "text": "兼职，还有各种课程等等"}]